 "id": "factory",
 "text": "So Mirabel sent for EPAM. They did not bring a dozen scribes. They brought a small team, and a scriptorium that never sleeps. One quill asks the questions she had not thought of. One draws up the plan. Several write at once. One reads every page back. And one carries the finished work to the shelf. The quills are tireless. The judgement is human.",
